DepthCalc GitHub edition

Adapted from the existing DepthCalc application supplied in this workspace.
Geometry, projection, coverage, IDW, OSM lake selection, map rendering,
cartographic labels, and PDF export were reused or adapted. See
 docs/IMPLEMENTATION.md for provenance and deliberate differences.

OpenStreetMap data: © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL.
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
Map tiles are requested directly from https://tile.openstreetmap.org.
Shorelines are requested directly from https://overpass-api.de.
